label Dresser
Sienna: This dresser was bought from a nearby market.
Sienna: I kept the cloth over it so the dust won’t settle until I’ve properly organized everything.
Sienna: But now, it just looks ominous.
Sienna: The thought of unveiling it and seeing something other than myself scares me.
if {interactables_clicked} == 16.0:
	jump endings/